  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "力平衡了4 牛顿的力. 不过，由图可以看出，这小力的力臂却",
        "比大力的力臂长出了一倍."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据这样的实验就可以找出杠杆平衡的规律是：**若作用**",
        "**在杠杆上的各力与它们的力臂成反比时，杠杆就平衡.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这个规律可以用公式表示成："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{F_1}{F_2}=\\frac{l_2}{l_1}$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式中$F_1$和$F_2$——作用在杠杆上的力，$l_1$和$l_2$——这些力的力",
        "臂（图181）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "关于杠杆平衡的这一规律是阿基米德发现的."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由这一规律就可以看出，借助于杠杆确实能够用较小的",
        "力平衡甚至克服较大的力. 而为此只需选择适当长度的力臂.",
        "例如，图176，а 所示的杠杆，其一个臂大约是另一个臂的2",
        "倍. 这就是说，假若工人施于$B$点的力是400 牛顿，则他就能",
        "抬起800 牛顿重的重物，亦即质量为80 千克的重物. 要抬起",
        "更重的重物，还可以把工人施于杠杆的力的力臂加长."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例题　**若不考虑摩擦**，要用杠杆把质量为240 千克的石",
        "头撬起来，需使多大的力？已知这个力的力臂是2.4 米，而石头",
        "所受的重力的力臂是0.6 米."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解：根据杠杆平衡的规律有"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{F}{P}=\\frac{l_2}{l_1}$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是　　　　　$F=P\\frac{l_2}{l_1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "石头的重量$P=gm$，$P=9.8$ 牛顿/千克$\\times240$ 千克$\\approx2400$ 牛",
        "顿."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
